      "message": "I have gone with Option 2, and added `charger_current_battery_params()` as fake to my test. See [4915709](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4915709/22/zephyr/test/drivers/usbc_intel_alt_mode/src/usbc_intel_alt_mode.c#56).\nIf this approach is OK, we can abandon this CL.",
